from m6-cresselia.replay
# Event branch m6-event-darkrai (docs/decisions.md: the dev-only event flag;
# docs/research/postgame.md §6): the Member Card distribution (`event darkrai`) after m6-cresselia woke the boy. In
# Canalave's Harbor Inn the on-transition starts the event (VAR_DARKRAI_EVENT_STATE 1, the Gym Guide's reservation);
# the frame script lays the player down and the dream warps to Newmoon Island (FLAG_TRAVELED_TO_NEWMOON_ISLAND,
# state 2). In the forest Darkrai's L50 battle, caught with the Master Ball: FLAG_CAUGHT_DARKRAI; the voice sends the
# player back to the inn, awake in Canalave (state 3).
event darkrai
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_CANALAVE_CITY_HARBOR_INN 4 7 up
advance text 3000
until idle 3000
+0 assert state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_NEWMOON_ISLAND"
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_DARKRAI_EVENT_STATE 2
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_TRAVELED_TO_NEWMOON_ISLAND true
+0 press up
until position 152 274 6000
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 154 274 6000
+0 release right
+0 press up
until position 154 268 6000
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 149 268 6000
+0 release left
+0 press down
until position 149 269 6000
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 143 269 6000
+0 release left
+0 press down
until position 143 270 6000
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 137 270 6000
+0 release left
+0 press up
until position 137 269 6000
+0 release up
+0 press up
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_NEWMOON_ISLAND_FOREST" 300
+0 release up
until idle 600
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_HIDE_NEWMOON_ISLAND_FOREST_DARKRAI false
+0 press up
until position 16 14 600
+0 release up
until idle 60
+0 press a
+1 release a
advance text 3000
battle catch platinum:ITEM_MASTER_BALL 20000
+0 assert battle scripted platinum:SPECIES_DARKRAI caught
advance text 20000
until idle 6000
+0 assert flag platinum:FLAG_CAUGHT_DARKRAI true
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_DARKRAI_EVENT_STATE 3
+0 assert party 5 platinum:SPECIES_DARKRAI
